cx='613' cy='68' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='74' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>工具使用次数</text><circle cx='613' cy='102' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='108' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>AI 帮助下的完成率</text><circle cx='613' cy='136' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='142' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>单次平均分上涨</text><circle cx='613' cy='170' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='176' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>把某一项工具的研究效果推广到整个系统</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E7BE0', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>过渡路径四级：单项工具使用 → 同一课时的作业与复盘 → 阶段考试和长期记录 → 课程、助教与教师协同；两种模式的效果与适用条件需分别评价</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：两种教学模式与应用边界.md §6–§7</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 112 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>